519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "170589075", "author": {"steamid": "76561198388373070", "personaname": "Nozdormu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nozdormu/", "num_games_owned": 143, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4119, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2681, "last_played": 1782149611, "avatar": "0244904b8ec48f9e0355506d7bd5cd953385f20d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Rock me like a stone", "timestamp_created": 1721776661, "timestamp_updated": 1721776661, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "170587748", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000177185", "personaname": "Zoey", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Dessix/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 10304, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9397, "last_played": 1776547919, "avatar": "49806dcb47ca9a3a0d42da869a97c36048eadb30"}, "language": "english", "review": "While this is rare for me to say about anything ... This is actually a good game. It does tend to overwhelm a bit when played at the higher levels, and isn't particularly friendly to new players with its RNG mechanics for build options... But there are no serious flaws in technical execution, mechanical design, or overall implementation.\n\n- Gameplay: If you want to feel like you're working for a dystopian capitalist nightmare corporation, and aren't already doing so at your day job, this game will make you feel like that while also being overwhelmed by bugs, and your boss still won't give you bullets without a bribe in exchange.\n\n- Progression: Primarily randomized drops after the first 10 hours; finding the overclock item for the build you want can take literally months, so having a particular build in mind isn't ideal for this game. If you're okay with the game pushing you into things you wouldn't consider your expected playstyle, this is much less of a problem.\n\n- Key bindings: They work. I'm playing on Dvorak with zero issues whatsoever.\n\n- Performance? If it runs at a reasonable framerate in an empty room, you're probably going to have the same framerate during a massive battle with hundreds of bugs pouring onto you from every surface while everything is on fire. It can be a bit demanding on hardware for the higher settings, but it is very consistent at any setting.", "timestamp_created": 1721774860, "timestamp_updated": 1721774860, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "170586730", "author": {"steamid": "76561199229992434", "personaname": "kimak-ool", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199229992434/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 26735, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 18178, "last_played": 1782064651, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the nicest games I have encountered. Darkness, Dwarves and Dangerous bugs\r\nAlso, it has a pretty sweet community", "timestamp_created": 1721773538, "timestamp_updated": 1721773538, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}